{
  "_readme": "Splat Attack! audio manifest. Files live in audio/music and audio/sfx (Opus WebM). 'vol' is 0-1 and is multiplied by the Music or Sounds slider (default 80%). More than one file under 'files' = one picked at random. 'pitch' = random pitch spread (0.1 = +/-10%). 'hold' sounds loop only while the game keeps asking for them. 'gap' = minimum ms between repeats. Missing files are skipped. Music: menu + one track per map, crossfaded. Each sound is reused for every event in its note. See docs/game-splat-attack.md (Sound).",
